      "story_id": 2,
      "headline": "Paris 'Willing' nations summit on Hormuz: Italy offers minesweepers pending parliamentary vote",
      "summary": "Meloni attended a summit at the \u00c9lys\u00e9e with Macron, Starmer, and Merz to discuss a European mission to secure freedom of navigation in the Strait of Hormuz. Italy offered to contribute minesweepers \u2014 Defense Minister Crosetto said eight of Italy's ten are deployable and could reach the area in 20-25 days \u2014 but Meloni conditioned any deployment on prior parliamentary authorization. The summit produced a photo of European unity against a backdrop of continued US pressure on Italy over the Sigonella refusal, and sparked a domestic debate between parties on the conditions for Italian participation.",
