      "story_id": 5,
      "headline": "Salvini hosts European 'Patriots' rally at Milan's Piazza Duomo with Bardella and Wilders; counter-protests erupt",
      "summary": "Lega leader Matteo Salvini organized a major rally branded 'Senza Paura \u2013 In Europa padroni a casa nostra' at Piazza Duomo in Milan, featuring far-right European politicians including Jordan Bardella (RN) and Geert Wilders (PVV). Salvini called for remigration, a points-based residency permit, an end to the EU Green Deal, a return to Russian gas purchases, and opposition to a European army. Turnout fell short of expectations \u2014 reports estimated 2,000-5,000 attendees \u2014 while three counter-demonstrations organized by centri sociali, Forza Italia (which brought second-generation immigrants), and left-wing parties drew comparable or larger crowds. The event highlighted Salvini's strategic divergence from both Meloni and coalition partner Forza Italia.",
